OL,3,GNEWSADrug rape husband says wife 'would
OL,4,Ahave been terrified', court hears      
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains         
OL,7,Fdistressing content                    
OL,9,FA husband who admits drugging and      
OL,10,Fraping his wife with strangers has told
OL,11,Fa court that if she had woken during   
OL,12,Fthe abuse, she would have been         
OL,13,F"terrified".                           
OL,15,FThe defendant, who has admitted        
OL,16,Fmultiple sexual offences dating back to
OL,17,F2004, said he drugged his wife so she  
OL,18,Fwould be unaware of the abuse by him   
OL,19,Fand other men.                         
